# Design System Rules

**ALWAYS use semantic colors from `frontend/lib/theme.ts` - NEVER use hardcoded Tailwind colors.**

Before using any color, check `frontend/lib/theme.ts` for available semantic colors. Use those instead of hardcoded values like `bg-yellow-500`, `text-green-600`, etc.

To change colors: Edit `frontend/lib/theme.ts` → `cssVariables.dark` - colors auto-sync to CSS variables and Tailwind classes.

**Check existing semantic colors before creating new ones.**
